meta {
  name: saveProductCustomGroup
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductCustomGroup",
    "params": {
      "product_group_id": 1,
      "product_id": 123,
      "_delete": false
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Assign or remove a product from a custom product group

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `product_group_id` | integer | yes | Internal ID of the product group |
  | `product_id` | integer | yes | Internal ID of the product |
  | `_delete` | boolean (nullable) | no | Set to true to remove the product from the group |

  **Example: Add product to custom group**. Set _delete=true to remove the product from the group.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductCustomGroup",
    "params": {
      "product_group_id": 1,
      "product_id": 123,
      "_delete": false
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_group_id": 1,
    "product_id": 123
  }
  ```
}
